---
import Section from '../Section.astro';
import { getProfile } from '../../lib/content';
const p = getProfile();
---
<Section id="about" title="About">
  <p>
    I study Computer Engineering at UFPel and hold a FAPERGS research fellowship with
    Tech&ApplieD-GM / Q-Flex. I previously researched deep learning and computer vision
    with ViTech.
  </p>
  <p>
    I build applied AI workflows and machine learning experiments with explicit validation.
    The project pages show the problem, design choices, evidence and limits behind each
    result.
  </p>
  <p>
    Research interests: {p.interests.join(', ').toLowerCase()}.
  </p>
</Section>
